   "durationInFrames": 73
  },
  {
   "id": "d1",
   "chapter": "THE DIAGNOSIS",
   "scene": "pipeline",
   "text": "Look at how the system is wired. A college teaches from a syllabus written years ago. The student turns it into a r\u00e9sum\u00e9. Software turns the r\u00e9sum\u00e9 into keywords. And an interview guesses the rest.",
