  {
   "id": "l2",
   "chapter": "THE MACHINE",
   "scene": "loop",
   "text": "Compile the demand. Map it to a shared graph. Find each person's gap. Practise on real work. Prove it on work you've never seen. Carry that proof to opportunity. And when the work changes, update only what changed.",
