   "scene": "aipair",
   "text": "First, the brief. Give it the logs, the code, the photo. Never the keys. Never a customer's data.",
   "audio": "capx/vo/ap2.wav",
   "speech_s": 6.205,
   "leadFrames": 4,
   "speechFrames": 186,
   "startFrame": 9609,
   "durationInFrames": 201
  },
  {
   "id": "ap3",
   "chapter": "06 \u00b7 AI PAIR",
   "scene": "aipair",
   "text": "Then it answers, fast, fluent and confident. And in every trial, one of its calls is wrong.",
   "audio": "capx/vo/ap3.wav",
   "speech_s": 5.246,
   "leadFrames": 4,
   "speechFrames": 157,
   "startFrame": 9810,
   "durationInFrames": 174
  },
  {
   "id": "ap4",
   "chapter": "06 \u00b7 AI PAIR",
   "scene": "aipair",
   "text": "Aarav's copilot offers two patches. Both pass every visible test. One swallows refunds. He ships the other, and names the test that proves it.",
   "audio": "capx/vo/ap4.wav",
   "speech_s": 7.653,
   "leadFrames": 4,
   "speechFrames": 230,
   "startFrame": 9984,
   "durationInFrames": 246
  },
  {
   "id": "ap5",
   "chapter": "06 \u00b7 AI PAIR",
   "scene": "aipair",
   "text": "On site, the electrician measures before trusting. The switch reads fine. The lamp reads open. The AI was wrong. The meter was right.",
   "audio": "capx/vo/ap5.wav",
   "speech_s": 7.677,
   "leadFrames": 4,
   "speechFrames": 230,
   "startFrame": 10230,
   "durationInFrames": 247
  },
  {
   "id": "ap6",
   "chapter": "06 \u00b7 AI PAIR",
   "scene": "aipair",
   "text": "Brief it. Catch it. Prove it. AI fluency, graded by code, on a signed receipt, for software and the trades.",
   "audio": "capx/vo/ap6.wav",
   "speech_s": 7.103,
   "leadFrames": 4,
   "speechFrames": 213,
   "startFrame": 10477,
   "durationInFrames": 241
  },
  {
   "id": "u3",
   "chapter": "05 \u00b7 UNSEEN PROOF",
   "scene": "lanes",
   "text": "Our rule is simple. AI teaches and explains. Code verifies what can be measured. Humans judge what needs judgement.",
   "audio": "capx/vo/u3.wav",
   "speech_s": 7.815,
   "leadFrames": 4,
   "speechFrames": 234,
   "startFrame": 10718,
   "durationInFrames": 251
  },
  {
   "id": "u4",
   "chapter": "05 \u00b7 UNSEEN PROOF",
   "scene": "lanes",
   "text": "No capability is ever awarded because an AI thought the answer looked good.",
   "audio": "capx/vo/u4.wav",
   "speech_s": 3.743,
   "leadFrames": 4,
   "speechFrames": 112,
   "startFrame": 10969,
   "durationInFrames": 141
  },
  {
   "id": "k1",
   "chapter": "07 \u00b7 SIGNED RECEIPT",
   "scene": "receipt",
   "text": "What comes out is a signed capability receipt. The exact task version. His submission. Every check that passed or failed. The conditions it ran under.",
   "audio": "capx/vo/k1.wav",
   "speech_s": 8.971,
   "leadFrames": 4,
   "speechFrames": 269,
   "startFrame": 11110,
   "durationInFrames": 284
  },
  {
   "id": "k2",
   "chapter": "07 \u00b7 SIGNED RECEIPT",
   "scene": "receipt",
   "text": "Aarav owns it. He chooses who sees it, and he can revoke it in one tap.",
   "audio": "capx/vo/k2.wav",
   "speech_s": 3.961,
   "leadFrames": 4,
   "speechFrames": 119,
   "startFrame": 11394,
   "durationInFrames": 141
  },
  {
   "id": "k3",
   "chapter": "07 \u00b7 SIGNED RECEIPT",
   "scene": "contrast",
   "text": "The r\u00e9sum\u00e9 said Aarav could debug. This shows what happened when he actually had to.",
   "audio": "capx/vo/k3.wav",
   "speech_s": 4.428,
   "leadFrames": 4,
   "speechFrames": 133,
   "startFrame": 11535,
   "durationInFrames": 167
  },
  {
   "id": "x1",
   "chapter": "08 \u00b7 OPPORTUNITY",
   "scene": "exchange",
   "text": "On Maya's side, there's no mystery score. She sees which requirements are proven, which are missing, and the evidence behind each one.",
   "audio": "capx/vo/x1.wav",
   "speech_s": 6.726,
   "leadFrames": 4,
   "speechFrames": 202,
   "startFrame": 11702,
   "durationInFrames": 216
  },
  {
   "id": "x2",
   "chapter": "08 \u00b7 OPPORTUNITY",
   "scene": "exchange",
   "text": "And because the graph is shared, the same proof counts at every employer that needs it. Prove once. Apply everywhere.",
   "audio": "capx/vo/x2.wav",
   "speech_s": 6.408,
   "leadFrames": 4,
   "speechFrames": 192,
   "startFrame": 11918,
   "durationInFrames": 220
  },
  {
   "id": "y1",
   "chapter": "09 \u00b7 MARKET DELTA",
   "scene": "delta",
   "text": "And then, the world changes.",
   "audio": "capx/vo/y1.wav",
   "speech_s": 1.419,
   "leadFrames": 4,
   "speechFrames": 43,
   "startFrame": 12138,
   "durationInFrames": 60
  },
  {
   "id": "y2",
   "chapter": "09 \u00b7 MARKET DELTA",
   "scene": "delta",
   "text": "The role now needs Docker and C I C D.",
   "audio": "capx/vo/y2.wav",
   "speech_s": 2.079,
   "leadFrames": 4,
   "speechFrames": 62,
   "startFrame": 12198,
   "durationInFrames": 77
  },
  {
   "id": "y3",
   "chapter": "09 \u00b7 MARKET DELTA",
   "scene": "delta",
   "text": "Most systems would send Aarav back to the start. CAPABLE recompiles the role, and adds only the delta: containers, C I C D, and the Linux they depend on.",
   "audio": "capx/vo/y3.wav",
   "speech_s": 8.131,
   "leadFrames": 4,
   "speechFrames": 244,
   "startFrame": 12275,
   "durationInFrames": 259
  },
  {
   "id": "y4",
   "chapter": "09 \u00b7 MARKET DELTA",
   "scene": "delta",
   "text": "Everything he already proved still counts.",
   "audio": "capx/vo/y4.wav",
   "speech_s": 2.167,
   "leadFrames": 4,
   "speechFrames": 65,
   "startFrame": 12534,
   "durationInFrames": 81
  },
  {
   "id": "y5",
   "chapter": "09 \u00b7 MARKET DELTA",
   "scene": "delta",
   "text": "And no lab can validate those three yet, so CAPABLE says so. Awaiting validation. It never invents competence.",
   "audio": "capx/vo/y5.wav",
   "speech_s": 5.654,
   "leadFrames": 4,
   "speechFrames": 170,
   "startFrame": 12615,
   "durationInFrames": 195
  },
  {
   "id": "y6",
   "chapter": "09 \u00b7 MARKET DELTA",
   "scene": "notagain",
   "text": "The market changed. The pathway changed. The learner didn't start again.",
   "audio": "capx/vo/y6.wav",
   "speech_s": 3.864,
   "leadFrames": 4,
   "speechFrames": 116,
   "startFrame": 12810,
   "durationInFrames": 156
  },
  {
   "id": "n1",
   "chapter": "WHY NOBODY DOES THIS",
   "scene": "chain",
   "text": "So why doesn't this exist already?",
   "audio": "capx/vo/n1.wav",
   "speech_s": 1.637,
   "leadFrames": 4,
   "speechFrames": 49,
   "startFrame": 12966,
   "durationInFrames": 64
  },
  {
   "id": "n2",
   "chapter": "WHY NOBODY DOES THIS",
   "scene": "chain",
   "text": "Because the system is a chain of separate businesses. Course platforms sell completions. Job boards sell listings. Screening software sells filters. Staffing agencies earn more when people churn.",
   "audio": "capx/vo/n2.wav",
   "speech_s": 11.5,
   "leadFrames": 4,
   "speechFrames": 345,
   "startFrame": 13030,
   "durationInFrames": 360
  },
  {
   "id": "n3",
   "chapter": "WHY NOBODY DOES THIS",
   "scene": "chain",
   "text": "Each one optimises its own link. Nobody owns the loop.",
   "audio": "capx/vo/n3.wav",
   "speech_s": 3.043,
   "leadFrames": 4,
   "speechFrames": 91,
   "startFrame": 13390,
   "durationInFrames": 116
  },
  {
   "id": "n4",
   "chapter": "WHY NOBODY DOES THIS",
   "scene": "versus",
   "text": "That's why everyone else verifies what people claim. CAPABLE generates the work, and lets the work speak.",
   "audio": "capx/vo/n4.wav",
   "speech_s": 4.933,
   "leadFrames": 4,
   "speechFrames": 148,
   "startFrame": 13506,
   "durationInFrames": 173
  },
  {
   "id": "n5",
   "chapter": "WHY NOW",
   "scene": "whynow",
   "text": "And why now? AI made faking a signal almost free. It also made compiling demand and generating fresh work cheap. The technology that broke the signal can rebuild it, as long as it's never the judge.",
   "audio": "capx/vo/n5.wav",
   "speech_s": 11.584,
   "leadFrames": 4,
   "speechFrames": 348,
   "startFrame": 13679,
   "durationInFrames": 379
  },
  {
   "id": "o1",
   "chapter": "ONE INFRASTRUCTURE",
   "scene": "domains",
   "text": "And this isn't only for software. The same graph and the same receipts already run labs for data analysts, solar technicians and electricians, built offline-first for a basic phone.",
   "audio": "capx/vo/o1.wav",
   "speech_s": 9.622,
   "leadFrames": 4,
   "speechFrames": 289,
   "startFrame": 14058,
   "durationInFrames": 308
  },
  {
   "id": "o2",
   "chapter": "ONE INFRASTRUCTURE",
   "scene": "rail",
   "text": "That makes CAPABLE infrastructure. Next: auditable, name-blind verification for enterprises. Hiring in a box for small businesses with no HR. Voice-first proof for frontline workers, in their own language. And curricula that sync to live demand, for colleges and ITIs.",
   "audio": "capx/vo/o2.wav",
   "speech_s": 14.142,
   "leadFrames": 4,
   "speechFrames": 424,
   "startFrame": 14366,
   "durationInFrames": 455
  },
  {
   "id": "bm1",
   "chapter": "THE BUSINESS",
   "scene": "money",
   "text": "And it pays for itself. Learners never pay to prove what they can do.",
   "audio": "capx/vo/bm1.wav",
   "speech_s": 3.411,
   "leadFrames": 4,
   "speechFrames": 102,
   "startFrame": 14821,
   "durationInFrames": 116
  },
  {
   "id": "bm2",
   "chapter": "THE BUSINESS",
   "scene": "money",
   "text": "Employers pay per verified shortlist, a fraction of the fifteen to thirty percent a recruiter charges. Enterprises license verification, and AI Pair to upskill their own teams. Colleges pay for outcome data they can finally show.",
   "audio": "capx/vo/bm2.wav",
   "speech_s": 12.858,
   "leadFrames": 4,
   "speechFrames": 386,
   "startFrame": 14937,
   "durationInFrames": 400
  },
  {
   "id": "bm3",
   "chapter": "THE BUSINESS",
   "scene": "money",
   "text": "And every employer who joins makes every receipt worth more. That's the moat.",
   "audio": "capx/vo/bm3.wav",
   "speech_s": 3.789,
   "leadFrames": 4,
   "speechFrames": 114,
   "startFrame": 15337,
   "durationInFrames": 145
  },
  {
   "id": "f1",
   "chapter": "THE CLOSE",
   "scene": "meet",
   "text": "Today, Aarav spends two years grinding puzzles a machine can solve, and only then asks if they matter.",
   "audio": "capx/vo/f1.wav",
   "speech_s": 4.935,
   "leadFrames": 4,
   "speechFrames": 148,
   "startFrame": 15482,
   "durationInFrames": 163
  },
  {
   "id": "f2",
   "chapter": "THE CLOSE",
   "scene": "meet",
   "text": "Maya spends months filtering, and still wonders if her hire can do the work.",
   "audio": "capx/vo/f2.wav",
   "speech_s": 3.427,
   "leadFrames": 4,
   "speechFrames": 103,
   "startFrame": 15645,
   "durationInFrames": 119
  },
  {
   "id": "f3",
   "chapter": "THE CLOSE",
   "scene": "meet",
   "text": "Both questions arrive too late. CAPABLE asks them first.",
   "audio": "capx/vo/f3.wav",
   "speech_s": 3.524,
   "leadFrames": 4,
   "speechFrames": 106,
   "startFrame": 15764,
   "durationInFrames": 137
  },
  {
   "id": "f4",
   "chapter": "THE CLOSE",
   "scene": "mantra",
   "text": "The job description becomes the curriculum.",
   "audio": "capx/vo/f4.wav",
   "speech_s": 1.84,
   "leadFrames": 4,
   "speechFrames": 55,
   "startFrame": 15901,
   "durationInFrames": 68
  },
  {
   "id": "f5",
   "chapter": "THE CLOSE",
   "scene": "mantra",
   "text": "The work becomes the proof.",
   "audio": "capx/vo/f5.wav",
   "speech_s": 1.32,
   "leadFrames": 4,
   "speechFrames": 40,
   "startFrame": 15969,
   "durationInFrames": 53
  },
  {
   "id": "f6",
   "chapter": "THE CLOSE",
   "scene": "mantra",
   "text": "The proof becomes opportunity.",
   "audio": "capx/vo/f6.wav",
   "speech_s": 1.28,
   "leadFrames": 4,
   "speechFrames": 38,
   "startFrame": 16022,
   "durationInFrames": 56
  },
  {
   "id": "f7",
   "chapter": "THE CLOSE",
   "scene": "mantra",
   "text": "And when the world changes, the pathway changes with it.",
   "audio": "capx/vo/f7.wav",
   "speech_s": 2.635,
   "leadFrames": 4,
   "speechFrames": 79,
   "startFrame": 16078,
   "durationInFrames": 113
  },
  {
   "id": "f8",
   "chapter": "THE CLOSE",
   "scene": "end",
   "text": "CAPABLE.",
   "audio": "capx/vo/f8.wav",
   "speech_s": 0.622,
   "leadFrames": 4,
   "speechFrames": 19,
   "startFrame": 16191,
   "durationInFrames": 146
  }
 ]
